WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.150
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.420 --> 01:34.940
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.280 --> 01:37.810
[Episode 39]

4
01:39.539 --> 01:44.759
[Outer defenses of Songpan County, Sichuan]

5
01:57.570 --> 02:00.170
How many times has the Communist Army charged?

6
02:01.130 --> 02:02.360
This is the ninth time.

7
02:02.360 --> 02:03.800
The fighting spirit of the Communist Army

8
02:03.800 --> 02:05.330
is terrifying.

9
02:05.610 --> 02:06.770
According to reconnaissance,

10
02:06.770 --> 02:08.680
the troops currently outside Songpan

11
02:08.680 --> 02:10.800
are only the vanguard of the Communist Army.

12
02:10.800 --> 02:13.010
Their main force is nearly 100,000 strong,

13
02:13.010 --> 02:14.560
less than 100 li away from us.

14
02:14.560 --> 02:15.490
Staff Officer Zhang.

15
02:15.490 --> 02:16.120
Here!

16
02:16.450 --> 02:17.960
Pass my order to Liao Ang.

17
02:18.329 --> 02:20.130
Before reinforcements arrive,

18
02:20.360 --> 02:21.960
not an inch of ground can be lost.

19
02:21.960 --> 02:22.730
Yes, sir!

20
02:27.930 --> 02:29.730
Report! Urgent telegram from Brigade Commander Liao!

21
02:29.730 --> 02:30.360
Read it.

22
02:30.770 --> 02:32.170
My unit is short of supplies.

23
02:32.170 --> 02:34.400
Request the commander to allocate supplies!

24
02:33.030 --> 02:36.579
[Hu Zongnan, Commander of the 2nd Column, 3rd Route Army of the Kuomintang's Communist Suppression Forces]

25
02:35.730 --> 02:37.329
How much food do we have left?

26
02:37.610 --> 02:38.640
Our food

27
02:38.640 --> 02:40.240
is only enough for two days.

28
02:44.640 --> 02:46.079
Urge the quartermaster immediately.

29
02:46.079 --> 02:47.640
The men can't fight on an empty stomach.

30
02:47.640 --> 02:48.170
Yes, sir!

31
02:53.530 --> 02:54.320
Commander.

32
02:54.680 --> 02:56.270
Right now, all our food

33
02:56.290 --> 02:58.230
needs to be transported from Jiangyou.

34
02:58.230 --> 02:59.360
The road is blocked.

35
02:59.360 --> 03:02.180
We rely entirely on porters carrying loads over the snowy mountains,

36
03:02.180 --> 03:03.710
a round trip of 400 to 500 li.

37
03:03.840 --> 03:06.080
The porters are dying along the way.

38
03:08.590 --> 03:10.650
Then increase the number of porters.

39
03:10.790 --> 03:13.150
It doesn't matter if a few porters die of exhaustion.

40
03:13.150 --> 03:15.640
If we fail to complete the Generalissimo's battle plan,

41
03:15.640 --> 03:17.440
we will all be held responsible.

42
03:17.520 --> 03:18.329
Yes, sir.

43
03:28.050 --> 03:29.110
This is all we have.

44
03:29.329 --> 03:30.130
One bite each.

45
03:37.690 --> 03:38.480
Here.

46
03:40.500 --> 03:41.290
Here.

47
03:46.920 --> 03:47.730
Here.

48
04:13.510 --> 04:14.420
Eat.

49
04:24.770 --> 04:29.320
[Temporary Headquarters of the Red 1st Red Army Corps, Outer Songpan, Sichuan]

50
04:25.820 --> 04:27.740
How much food is left?

51
04:28.530 --> 04:29.650
Not much left.

52
04:29.540 --> 04:33.000
[Nie Rongzhen, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Corps]

53
04:30.000 --> 04:31.090
Several companies

54
04:31.930 --> 04:32.610
have gone two or three days

55
04:32.610 --> 04:34.159
without a full meal.

56
04:33.790 --> 04:37.150
[Lin Biao, Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

57
04:35.000 --> 04:37.050
The Military Commission is also trying to find a way,

58
04:37.050 --> 04:39.250
but collecting grain is too difficult.

59
04:40.320 --> 04:41.850
The leaders of the Central Committee and the Military Commission

60
04:41.850 --> 04:43.090
also don't have enough to eat.

61
04:43.090 --> 04:44.620
They are also going hungry.

62
04:51.040 --> 04:57.010
[Mao'ergai, Songpang County, Sichuan]

63
05:47.120 --> 05:47.880
Comrades.

64
05:47.880 --> 05:49.050
I have good news

65
05:49.120 --> 05:50.310
and bad news.

66
05:50.440 --> 05:51.800
Which do you want to hear first?

67
05:51.800 --> 05:54.050
Guo, you're doing this again.

68
05:54.610 --> 05:56.270
Let's hear the bad news first.

69
05:56.530 --> 05:57.610
The bad news is,

70
05:57.880 --> 05:59.120
after this meal,

71
05:59.200 --> 06:00.290
our Company

72
06:02.120 --> 06:03.290
will be out of food.

73
06:06.530 --> 06:08.760
Guo, what about the good news?

74
06:08.880 --> 06:09.680
The good news?

75
06:10.200 --> 06:12.260
The good news is that after this meal,

76
06:12.440 --> 06:13.360
we

77
06:14.500 --> 06:16.180
can have a feast.

78
06:16.350 --> 06:17.700
-A feast? -A feast?

79
06:18.000 --> 06:18.490
A feast?

80
06:18.490 --> 06:19.200
Guo.

81
06:19.290 --> 06:20.880
You're so hungry you're rolling your eyes,

82
06:20.880 --> 06:22.280
and you're still joking.

83
06:22.490 --> 06:24.530
We won't even have this porridge for the next meal,

84
06:24.530 --> 06:25.760
let alone a feast.

85
06:30.090 --> 06:31.090
What is this?

86
06:31.170 --> 06:32.900
-A leather bag. -A leather bag.

87
06:33.760 --> 06:34.730
We

88
06:35.250 --> 06:37.380
can have some meat for a change, right?

89
06:37.880 --> 06:38.150
Guo.

90
06:38.170 --> 06:38.680
Meat?

91
06:38.710 --> 06:39.909
How can we eat this?

92
06:39.930 --> 06:40.800
Is this edible?

93
06:41.850 --> 06:43.380
You don't understand this.

94
06:44.050 --> 06:45.560
First, stew this leather bag

95
06:45.560 --> 06:46.650
until it's soft.

96
06:47.000 --> 06:48.440
Then cut it into shreds,

97
06:48.730 --> 06:50.409
and mix it with wild vegetables.

98
06:50.409 --> 06:51.490
Then you can eat it.

99
06:51.970 --> 06:52.900
It's delicious.

100
06:54.350 --> 06:55.150
Comrades,

101
06:55.560 --> 06:57.050
no matter what time it is,

102
06:57.880 --> 06:59.800
we must be optimistic, right?

103
07:00.000 --> 07:02.060
To make a revolution, we must be optimistic.

104
07:02.060 --> 07:02.910
-Yes! -Yes!

105
07:02.930 --> 07:03.680
Guo is quite optimistic.

106
07:03.680 --> 07:04.090
Yes.

107
07:04.320 --> 07:04.850
Look.

108
07:05.000 --> 07:06.120
One, two...

109
07:06.460 --> 07:09.020
There are so many cowhides, right?

110
07:09.290 --> 07:10.750
Enough for several meals!

111
07:11.490 --> 07:12.390
Guo, I have to say,

112
07:12.390 --> 07:13.850
you are really something.

113
07:14.050 --> 07:22.540
[Upper Luhua, Heishui, Sichuan]

114
07:19.470 --> 07:20.070
Jiaxiang,

115
07:20.560 --> 07:21.490
you are injured.

116
07:21.800 --> 07:22.800
Take a rest.

117
07:23.000 --> 07:23.800
I'm fine.

118
07:24.090 --> 07:27.820
We finally bought some highland barley from the fellow villagers.

119
07:27.850 --> 07:30.510
If we work a little longer, we'll have more food.

120
07:31.090 --> 07:32.650
Runzhi, Luofu.

121
07:33.409 --> 07:33.800
Mr. Lin.

122
07:33.800 --> 07:35.130
I brought you some food.

123
07:35.880 --> 07:37.530
You, the Minister of Supply,

124
07:37.730 --> 07:38.930
brought us supplies?

125
07:41.970 --> 07:42.870
Thanks for your hard work.

126
07:42.870 --> 07:44.940
Sorry, just a few pancakes.

127
07:48.240 --> 07:49.050
Come on.

128
07:49.680 --> 07:50.650
Let's share it.

129
07:55.570 --> 07:56.240
Okay.

130
07:57.920 --> 07:58.440
Here.

131
07:58.840 --> 08:00.370
Okay, thank you, Chairman.

132
08:02.500 --> 08:03.200
Mr. Lin.

133
08:03.440 --> 08:05.240
I won't eat. I've already eaten.

134
08:06.540 --> 08:08.170
The salt seller drinks plain soup.

135
08:08.170 --> 08:09.880
The bricklayer lives in a thatched cottage.

136
08:09.880 --> 08:11.230
The weaver has no clothes.

137
08:11.230 --> 08:13.090
I'm afraid you don't have a grain of food in your stomach.

138
08:13.090 --> 08:13.650
Just take it.

139
08:13.650 --> 08:14.900
Then what will you eat?

140
08:14.900 --> 08:16.460
I ate in the morning.

141
08:16.600 --> 08:17.510
I'm not hungry yet.

142
08:17.510 --> 08:19.770
The Chairman just drank three bowls of water this morning.

143
08:19.770 --> 08:20.700
Just don't talk.

144
08:20.930 --> 08:21.890
Eat the pancake quickly,

145
08:21.890 --> 08:23.090
so you can work well.

146
08:24.530 --> 08:25.200
Runzhi.

147
08:25.970 --> 08:26.610
Luofu.

148
08:27.530 --> 08:29.060
I'm not complaining to you.

149
08:29.160 --> 08:30.690
I really have no choice.

150
08:31.120 --> 08:33.440
The land in this area is barren,

151
08:33.679 --> 08:35.720
and the Tibetans have run away,

152
08:35.720 --> 08:37.320
leaving nine out of ten houses empty.

153
08:37.320 --> 08:39.890
The grain collection teams I send out every day

154
08:39.890 --> 08:41.950
almost always return empty-handed.

155
08:42.360 --> 08:43.360
Some comrades

156
08:43.890 --> 08:46.250
starved to death on the way to collect grain.

157
08:46.250 --> 08:49.170
And some comrades, during the grain collection process,

158
08:49.170 --> 08:51.130
were attacked by reactionary armed forces,

159
08:50.850 --> 08:51.990
[Lin Boqu, Head of the General Supply Department of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

160
08:51.320 --> 08:53.120
and suffered heavy casualties.

161
08:54.940 --> 08:55.940
My idea is,

162
08:57.340 --> 08:59.700
first, keep the troops

163
09:00.050 --> 09:02.010
searching for grain

164
09:02.240 --> 09:04.050
hidden by local tyrants and evil gentry.

165
09:04.050 --> 09:04.800
Second,

166
09:04.930 --> 09:07.460
the troops continue to collect grain from the people,

167
09:07.460 --> 09:10.400
but must strictly observe discipline regarding the masses.

168
09:10.400 --> 09:11.670
If the land has an owner,

169
09:11.670 --> 09:13.600
we will buy it at the market price.

170
09:14.600 --> 09:17.530
If we can't find the owner for a while,

171
09:17.680 --> 09:20.560
we'll set up a sign in the field,

172
09:20.770 --> 09:21.560
clearly indicating

173
09:21.560 --> 09:24.960
the amount of grain harvested on it.

174
09:25.280 --> 09:26.200
In the future,

175
09:26.290 --> 09:28.360
our Tibetan friends can use the wooden sign

176
09:28.360 --> 09:29.850
to exchange for compensation.

177
09:29.850 --> 09:30.460
Of course,

178
09:30.600 --> 09:32.680
if the owner explicitly objects,

179
09:33.250 --> 09:35.170
no matter how hungry we are,

180
09:35.680 --> 09:37.210
we cannot take their grain.

181
09:37.250 --> 09:38.930
Okay, I'll go back and draft the regulations.

182
09:38.930 --> 09:40.050
We will strictly enforce them.

183
09:40.050 --> 09:40.850
Chairman Mao!

184
09:42.200 --> 09:43.860
-Brother Zewang. -Chairman.

185
09:45.530 --> 09:46.250
Chairman.

186
09:46.940 --> 09:49.250
I've persuaded a few more households to come back.

187
09:49.250 --> 09:50.320
They now

188
09:50.410 --> 09:52.410
understand the Red Army's policies

189
09:52.600 --> 09:55.400
and are willing to sell their grain to the Red Army.

190
09:55.530 --> 09:56.560
Brother Zewang.

191
09:57.240 --> 09:59.500
Not only did you let us stay in your house,

192
09:59.670 --> 10:01.650
but you also helped us collect grain and supplies.

193
10:01.650 --> 10:02.770
Thank you so much.

194
10:02.690 --> 10:04.980
[Zewang, a Tibetan headman]

195
10:03.080 --> 10:05.280
Chairman Mao, didn't you say it before?

196
10:05.530 --> 10:07.530
We treat each other with sincerity.

197
10:07.650 --> 10:09.530
We are family.

198
10:09.890 --> 10:11.680
Since you came to our Upper Luhua,

199
10:11.680 --> 10:13.010
you haven't taken a single grain

200
10:13.010 --> 10:14.520
of highland barley for free.

201
10:14.520 --> 10:16.850
You haven't broken a single tile.

202
10:17.410 --> 10:20.020
Isn't that treating us like family?

203
10:20.050 --> 10:20.770
Right?

204
10:21.010 --> 10:21.720
Yes.

205
10:22.680 --> 10:24.170
Treating each other with sincerity.

206
10:24.170 --> 10:25.770
The Red Army and our Tibetan compatriots

207
10:25.770 --> 10:26.930
are family.

208
10:27.220 --> 10:29.080
When the revolution succeeds in the future

209
10:29.080 --> 10:30.890
and we liberate the poor across the country,

210
10:30.890 --> 10:32.470
this credit belongs to all of us.

211
10:32.470 --> 10:33.020
Yes.

212
10:33.530 --> 10:34.130
Chairman.

213
10:34.200 --> 10:35.920
Hurry and send someone to buy grain with me.

214
10:35.920 --> 10:36.530
-I'll go with you. -Okay.

215
10:36.530 --> 10:37.220
I'll go with you.

216
10:37.220 --> 10:38.210
Okay, let's go.

217
10:38.230 --> 10:38.780
Okay.

218
10:42.720 --> 10:45.040
They don't have much grain to spare either.

219
10:45.040 --> 10:46.930
If they are willing to sell it to us,

220
10:46.930 --> 10:47.890
that's a favor.

221
10:48.380 --> 10:49.140
As for us,

222
10:49.300 --> 10:52.340
we owe the people in the Tibetan areas too many favors.

223
10:52.770 --> 10:53.840
I hope the troops

224
10:54.050 --> 10:55.720
can head north to Gannan soon.

225
10:56.570 --> 10:57.480
I won't eat.

226
10:57.510 --> 10:58.290
You go, take it.

227
10:58.290 --> 10:59.890
I'm afraid there's trouble.

228
11:00.770 --> 11:02.230
Zhang Guotao's telegram has arrived again.

229
11:02.230 --> 11:03.060
What did he say?

230
11:03.060 --> 11:05.750
This time he didn't even try to hide it.

231
11:06.200 --> 11:07.260
He directly told us

232
11:07.370 --> 11:08.960
that if we don't resolve

233
11:08.990 --> 11:10.320
the organizational issue of command as soon as possible,

234
11:10.320 --> 11:13.250
he won't be able to march to Mao'ergai with firm resolve

235
11:13.250 --> 11:14.710
and eliminate Hu Zongnan.

236
11:23.030 --> 11:24.840
If two strands of straw rope can't be twisted together,

237
11:24.840 --> 11:26.400
the straw sandals can't be woven.

238
11:26.400 --> 11:27.460
Let's talk inside.

239
11:29.730 --> 11:31.730
Zhang, come here and keep grinding.

240
11:39.480 --> 11:40.360
Mao.

241
11:41.260 --> 11:42.380
This telegram

242
11:43.250 --> 11:45.720
was sent by Chen Changhao in his personal name.

243
11:45.720 --> 11:46.970
He directly suggested

244
11:46.970 --> 11:49.250
appointing Zhang Guotao as Chairman of the Military Commission,

245
11:49.250 --> 11:51.850
Me, Zhu De, as Frontline Commander-in-Chief,

246
11:51.930 --> 11:53.520
and Enlai as Chief of Staff.

247
11:54.010 --> 11:55.370
He also demanded that the Military Commission

248
11:55.370 --> 11:57.050
have dictatorial power,

249
11:57.080 --> 11:58.670
and to report in person.

250
11:58.830 --> 12:02.260
He is forcing our hand on behalf of Zhang Guotao.

251
12:02.580 --> 12:05.580
The comrades below may not understand the situation.

252
12:06.210 --> 12:08.410
This is all instigated by Zhang Guotao.

253
12:10.410 --> 12:14.010
It seems we need to hold another

254
12:14.130 --> 12:15.260
Politburo meeting.

255
12:15.480 --> 12:16.880
Having a meeting is fine.

256
12:16.960 --> 12:18.800
Didn't they want to report in person?

257
12:18.800 --> 12:20.010
Then invite Comrades Zhang Guotao,

258
12:20.010 --> 12:22.840
Chen Changhao, and Xu Xiangqian to attend.

259
12:23.000 --> 12:25.050
We will first discuss the organizational issue of military command,

260
12:25.050 --> 12:26.310
then military issues.

261
12:26.530 --> 12:27.790
We are all Communists.

262
12:27.930 --> 12:29.260
Let's be open and honest

263
12:29.410 --> 12:30.770
and speak plainly.

264
12:31.250 --> 12:32.770
Don't play the Kuomintang's game

265
12:32.770 --> 12:34.170
of feigning compliance.

266
12:37.650 --> 12:39.370
Zhang Guotao is a powerful figure

267
12:39.370 --> 12:40.300
and a careerist.

268
12:40.770 --> 12:42.650
If you don't give him a substantive position,

269
12:42.650 --> 12:43.960
he won't let it go.

270
12:44.720 --> 12:46.680
For the sake of unity, the Central Committee

271
12:46.680 --> 12:48.280
still has to make a concession.

272
12:48.280 --> 12:49.560
Otherwise, the two main armies

273
12:49.560 --> 12:51.160
won't be able to unite as one.

274
12:51.800 --> 12:54.720
But Chen Changhao recommended him

275
12:55.190 --> 12:57.250
to be Chairman of the Military Commission.

276
12:57.250 --> 13:00.060
Commander-in-Chief Zhu's position as Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission

277
13:00.060 --> 13:01.120
must not be shaken.

278
13:01.940 --> 13:02.850
Otherwise, we cannot explain it

279
13:02.850 --> 13:05.910
to the vast number of Red Army commanders and fighters.

280
13:08.250 --> 13:09.980
We can't give him the chairmanship of the Military Commission.

281
13:09.980 --> 13:12.730
And he won't settle for being Vice Chairman.

282
13:13.040 --> 13:14.200
What should we do?

283
13:15.600 --> 13:16.650
Why don't I just

284
13:16.840 --> 13:19.250
give up my position as the general person in charge

285
13:19.250 --> 13:20.410
to him?

286
13:24.840 --> 13:25.770
Inappropriate.

287
13:26.890 --> 13:29.290
What Zhang Guotao wants is military power.

288
13:29.390 --> 13:30.920
If you give him the position of general person in charge,

289
13:30.920 --> 13:32.250
he may not be satisfied.

290
13:32.460 --> 13:33.830
But if you really give it to him,

291
13:33.830 --> 13:36.030
I'm afraid there will be trouble later.

292
13:36.210 --> 13:37.530
Then what should we do?

293
13:43.130 --> 13:44.060
I think we should

294
13:44.440 --> 13:47.680
give him the position of General Political Commissar of the Red Army.

295
13:47.680 --> 13:49.010
It's the most suitable.

296
13:49.130 --> 13:50.570
It gives him military power,

297
13:50.570 --> 13:51.710
but doesn't let him grasp all the military power

298
13:51.710 --> 13:52.920
in his hands.

299
13:54.050 --> 13:56.770
This is a pretty good idea.

300
13:57.720 --> 14:00.370
But the current General Political Commissar of the Red Army

301
14:00.370 --> 14:01.250
is Comrade Enlai.

302
14:01.250 --> 14:01.720
Yes.

303
14:02.210 --> 14:03.170
Will he agree?

304
14:06.560 --> 14:08.720
Let's go discuss it with Enlai together.

305
14:08.720 --> 14:09.370
Okay.

306
14:10.680 --> 14:11.810
I completely agree.

307
14:12.080 --> 14:13.310
-Enlai. -Comrade Enlai.

308
14:13.310 --> 14:14.070
Have a seat.

309
14:14.250 --> 14:15.050
Enlai, quick.

310
14:15.130 --> 14:15.920
You are still sick.

311
14:15.920 --> 14:16.920
-Come, sit. -Sit.

312
14:17.600 --> 14:19.200
Even if you didn't come to me,

313
14:19.570 --> 14:21.000
I had the same thought.

314
14:25.440 --> 14:28.200
My personal gains and losses are a small matter.

315
14:28.840 --> 14:31.480
Getting 100,000 Red Army soldiers to unite

316
14:31.690 --> 14:34.620
and break out of the encirclement is no small matter.

317
14:34.940 --> 14:37.300
Enlai, no matter what,

318
14:37.960 --> 14:39.160
you've been wronged.

319
14:40.290 --> 14:42.090
Endure for the sake of the Party.

320
14:42.490 --> 14:45.370
If my slight grievance

321
14:45.840 --> 14:48.840
can make Comrade Zhang Guotao change his mind,

322
14:49.170 --> 14:50.410
it's all worth it.

323
14:51.010 --> 14:52.600
What I'm worried about now is

324
14:52.600 --> 14:54.720
that the conflict between us and Zhang Guotao

325
14:54.720 --> 14:56.050
is just the beginning.

326
14:58.250 --> 15:00.370
What will be, will be.

327
15:01.240 --> 15:02.310
We can't force it.

328
15:03.110 --> 15:05.040
We can only deal with it as it comes.

329
15:11.840 --> 15:14.240
While we make concessions to Zhang Guotao,

330
15:14.250 --> 15:16.310
we must also stick to our principles.

331
15:16.670 --> 15:18.240
At this Politburo meeting,

332
15:19.050 --> 15:21.170
we need to objectively evaluate the work

333
15:21.170 --> 15:22.600
of the Red 4th Front Army.

334
15:22.960 --> 15:24.560
At the same time, politically,

335
15:24.560 --> 15:25.730
we must also give Zhang Guotao

336
15:25.730 --> 15:27.660
appropriate advice and warnings.

337
15:43.750 --> 15:46.350
On July 18, 1935,

338
15:46.830 --> 15:48.610
the CPC Central Committee held a meeting of the Standing Committee

339
15:48.610 --> 15:50.560
of the Politburo in Luhua.

340
15:51.770 --> 15:52.900
The meeting decided

341
15:52.910 --> 15:56.790
to appoint Zhang Guotao as the General Political Commissar of the Red Army,

342
15:56.790 --> 16:00.320
Chen Changhao as a member of the Standing Committee of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

343
16:00.320 --> 16:03.290
and Bo Gu as the Director of the General Political Department.

344
16:03.290 --> 16:04.600
All Red Army units

345
16:04.820 --> 16:07.330
were to be directly commanded by the Commander-in-Chief

346
16:07.330 --> 16:11.650
and General Political Commissar of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army.

347
16:11.650 --> 16:14.200
Faced with the huge concessions made by the Central Committee,

348
16:14.200 --> 16:16.330
Zhang Guotao was still not satisfied.

349
16:17.210 --> 16:18.690
He proposed at the meeting

350
16:19.080 --> 16:21.010
to increase the number of members of the Politburo

351
16:21.010 --> 16:22.930
and the Central Committee,

352
16:23.480 --> 16:25.130
intending to create a majority faction

353
16:25.130 --> 16:26.620
in the central leadership.

354
16:26.620 --> 16:29.080
The Central Committee explicitly refused.

355
16:35.290 --> 16:36.410
Thrust! Stab!

356
16:36.600 --> 16:37.440
Kill!

357
16:38.250 --> 16:39.200
Thrust! Stab!

358
16:39.320 --> 16:40.200
Kill!

359
16:40.960 --> 16:42.010
Thrust! Stab!

360
16:42.080 --> 16:42.960
Kill!

361
16:43.600 --> 16:44.680
Thrust! Stab!

362
16:44.890 --> 16:45.730
Kill!

363
16:46.860 --> 16:47.970
Thrust! Stab!

364
16:48.080 --> 16:48.840
Kill!

365
16:50.010 --> 16:51.080
Thrust! Stab!

366
16:51.300 --> 16:52.180
Kill!

367
16:53.020 --> 16:54.950
Where are Changhao and Xiangqian?

368
16:55.160 --> 16:57.820
Comrade Changhao won't arrive until tomorrow afternoon.

369
16:57.820 --> 16:59.320
Comrade Xiangqian is far away.

370
16:59.320 --> 17:02.120
He won't arrive until the morning after tomorrow.

371
17:03.680 --> 17:04.810
Comrade Chen Geng.

372
17:10.240 --> 17:11.170
Chairman Zhang.

373
17:13.910 --> 17:14.970
What are you doing?

374
17:15.500 --> 17:17.490
Vice Chairman Zhou has been having diarrhea lately.

375
17:17.490 --> 17:20.190
I took some comrades to dig up some wild onions for him.

376
17:20.190 --> 17:21.720
I'm going to send them over.

377
17:22.849 --> 17:25.720
It seems you have a deep affection for Vice Chairman Zhou.

378
17:25.510 --> 17:28.430
[Chen Geng, Regiment Commander of the Cadre Regiment of the Military Commission Column]

379
17:26.040 --> 17:27.130
When we were in Shanghai,

380
17:27.130 --> 17:28.990
Vice Chairman Zhou was my leader.

381
17:29.480 --> 17:30.280
I know.

382
17:30.650 --> 17:31.410
Chen Geng.

383
17:32.000 --> 17:33.330
We haven't seen each other for a few years,

384
17:33.330 --> 17:34.990
but I've heard a lot about you.

385
17:35.650 --> 17:37.200
You commanded the Cadre Regiment

386
17:37.200 --> 17:40.330
and made great contributions several times when the Central Red Army was in danger.

387
17:40.330 --> 17:43.000
It seems your ability to lead troops in battle has improved again.

388
17:43.000 --> 17:44.600
My personal ability is not high.

389
17:44.600 --> 17:47.430
It's the Central Revolutionary Military Commission that commands well.

390
17:47.430 --> 17:49.630
It's good that you have this awareness.

391
17:50.120 --> 17:50.970
Chen Geng.

392
17:51.960 --> 17:53.890
I happen to have a question for you.

393
17:53.960 --> 17:56.280
You see, you've been in the 1st Front Army

394
17:56.310 --> 17:58.030
and the 4th Front Army.

395
17:58.280 --> 17:59.210
What do you think

396
17:59.370 --> 18:02.330
are the differences or characteristics

397
18:02.760 --> 18:05.160
of the 1st Front Army and the 4th Front Army?

398
18:06.780 --> 18:08.440
[Huang Chao, Secretary-General of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission and the Sichuan-Shaanxi Provincial Soviet Government]

399
18:12.480 --> 18:13.850
The difference is huge.

400
18:14.610 --> 18:15.540
Tell me about it.

401
18:16.210 --> 18:16.820
Look,

402
18:16.850 --> 18:17.850
the 1st Front Army

403
18:21.600 --> 18:22.680
has a small head.

404
18:24.020 --> 18:24.750
Look at this.

405
18:24.890 --> 18:26.060
The 4th Front Army

406
18:26.290 --> 18:28.010
has a big head.

407
18:29.060 --> 18:30.660
And the color of the clothes.

408
18:30.890 --> 18:31.930
Ours is lighter.

409
18:31.960 --> 18:32.960
This one is darker.

410
18:32.960 --> 18:34.490
The rest are about the same.

411
18:34.680 --> 18:36.340
See how big the difference is?

412
18:42.290 --> 18:43.570
Ah, Chen Geng.

413
18:43.810 --> 18:46.610
I didn't expect that not only do you fight well,

414
18:47.000 --> 18:50.000
but your eloquence is also getting better and better.

415
18:51.910 --> 18:52.710
Alright then.

416
18:52.990 --> 18:55.280
But I'm more interested in knowing what's under the small head

417
18:55.280 --> 18:57.440
you just mentioned.

418
18:57.900 --> 19:00.180
And what's under the big head

419
19:00.860 --> 19:02.020
as well?

420
19:04.610 --> 19:05.540
Chairman Zhang.

421
19:06.570 --> 19:08.170
Then I'll tell you the truth.

422
19:09.000 --> 19:11.890
The soldiers of the 1st Front Army are brave in battle,

423
19:11.890 --> 19:14.290
well-organized, and highly disciplined.

424
19:14.850 --> 19:16.250
As for the 4th Front Army.

425
19:16.640 --> 19:18.270
I'm not saying the soldiers of the 4th Front Army

426
19:18.270 --> 19:21.000
are not brave in battle. They are also very brave.

427
19:21.240 --> 19:24.440
It's just that some individuals are less organized

428
19:24.910 --> 19:26.310
and poorly disciplined.

429
19:32.160 --> 19:34.090
These are your true thoughts.

430
19:36.370 --> 19:37.090
Huang Chao.

431
19:37.920 --> 19:40.090
Chen Geng is exactly the kind of person I like.

432
19:40.090 --> 19:43.620
He's not the kind of person who says one thing and means another.

433
19:44.380 --> 19:47.310
You even complained about me in Shanghai.

434
19:47.820 --> 19:49.200
I think you were right to complain.

435
19:49.200 --> 19:50.260
And you did it well!

436
19:50.570 --> 19:53.280
This is the true nature of us Communists!

437
19:54.170 --> 19:55.000
I respect you!

438
19:55.200 --> 19:56.200
I respect you too!

439
19:56.550 --> 19:57.810
You are very generous.

440
19:58.070 --> 19:59.750
I did report some problems,

441
20:00.090 --> 20:01.510
but there's no personal grudge.

442
20:01.510 --> 20:03.300
It's all about work.

443
20:03.720 --> 20:04.590
I know.

444
20:05.840 --> 20:08.790
Your Cadre Regiment has merged with

445
20:08.810 --> 20:10.740
the Red Army School of the 4th Front Army.

446
20:10.740 --> 20:14.130
We will inevitably deal with each other in the future.

447
20:15.370 --> 20:15.890
Yes.

448
20:18.090 --> 20:18.820
Oh right,

449
20:19.850 --> 20:21.930
I saw you riding over just now.

450
20:22.530 --> 20:24.400
What's wrong with this horse?

451
20:25.720 --> 20:26.520
What's wrong?

452
20:27.090 --> 20:28.590
I saw you on the saddle,

453
20:28.610 --> 20:30.670
trying hard but it couldn't run fast.

454
20:32.280 --> 20:33.370
Is it disobedient?

455
20:35.130 --> 20:36.520
Or is it too old?

456
20:39.000 --> 20:39.680
Huang Chao,

457
20:40.560 --> 20:43.040
bring my horse to Comrade Chen Geng.

458
20:43.720 --> 20:46.000
My horse is very fast.

459
20:48.190 --> 20:48.960
Please don't!

460
20:48.960 --> 20:49.880
No need. No need.

461
20:49.880 --> 20:51.410
Thank you, Chairman Zhang.

462
20:52.040 --> 20:52.520
Well,

463
20:52.550 --> 20:54.150
my horse is a bit old,

464
20:54.410 --> 20:55.870
but as the old saying goes,

465
20:55.930 --> 20:57.390
an old horse knows the way.

466
20:57.730 --> 20:59.790
It knows the way and doesn't stumble.

467
20:59.880 --> 21:03.120
Besides, I've grown attached to it after so many years.

468
21:07.030 --> 21:08.430
You're loyal to old ties.

469
21:10.000 --> 21:11.800
It's good to be loyal to old ties.

470
21:11.930 --> 21:12.520
Alright.

471
21:12.900 --> 21:13.790
Go do your work.

472
21:14.130 --> 21:14.680
Okay.

473
21:27.020 --> 21:29.080
He likes to try hard for nothing, huh?

474
21:59.850 --> 22:00.980
Vice Chairman Zhou.

475
22:03.440 --> 22:04.650
Comrade Xiangqian.

476
22:05.220 --> 22:06.320
Vice Chairman Zhou,

477
22:06.320 --> 22:08.090
[Xu Xiangqian, Commander-in-Chief of the 4th Front Army]

478
22:06.720 --> 22:08.170
how did you get so thin?

479
22:09.280 --> 22:11.740
You haven't gained weight either, have you?

480
22:11.760 --> 22:14.090
After the Ma Ri Incident,

481
22:14.740 --> 22:18.000
since we parted at the meeting place on Snake Hill in Wuhan,

482
22:18.180 --> 22:19.710
it's been over eight years.

483
22:19.720 --> 22:20.680
Eight years.

484
22:21.810 --> 22:24.440
I still remember your speech at the meeting.

485
22:24.720 --> 22:25.850
You told us

486
22:26.170 --> 22:28.970
to understand the situation and firm our beliefs.

487
22:31.280 --> 22:32.300
The Chairman is here.

488
22:32.300 --> 22:33.430
Comrade Xiangqian.

489
22:34.200 --> 22:35.000
Chairman Mao!

490
22:35.850 --> 22:37.450
Those words just now were very good.

491
22:37.450 --> 22:38.440
Did you say them at the time,

492
22:38.440 --> 22:39.470
or did Vice Chairman Zhou?

493
22:39.470 --> 22:41.130
Vice Chairman Zhou said them.

494
22:42.240 --> 22:43.840
We meet again, Chairman Mao.

495
22:44.410 --> 22:45.540
Among these people,

496
22:45.680 --> 22:47.610
I've known Xiangqian the longest.

497
22:47.610 --> 22:48.480
In 1924,

498
22:48.510 --> 22:50.240
when I applied for the Whampoa Military Academy,

499
22:50.240 --> 22:51.370
it was in Shanghai.

500
22:51.890 --> 22:53.850
Chairman Mao was my chief examiner.

501
22:53.850 --> 22:56.330
Mao, you approved Xiangqian's passing,

502
22:56.520 --> 22:58.680
selecting a great general for the revolution.

503
22:58.680 --> 23:00.990
That counts as a great contribution to the revolution.

504
23:00.990 --> 23:03.240
As the chief examiner, I have both merits and faults.

505
23:03.240 --> 23:04.930
Although I let Xiangqian pass,

506
23:04.930 --> 23:06.390
I also let Hu Zongnan pass.

507
23:06.440 --> 23:07.810
Now he is in Songpan,

508
23:07.890 --> 23:09.220
blocking our way north.

509
23:10.610 --> 23:12.570
Comrade Xiangqian, let me introduce you.

510
23:12.570 --> 23:13.720
Commander-in-Chief Zhu.

511
23:13.720 --> 23:14.680
Hello, Commander-in-Chief.

512
23:14.680 --> 23:15.810
Comrade Xiangqian.

513
23:16.000 --> 23:17.090
Comrade Zhang Wentian (Luofu).

514
23:17.090 --> 23:17.830
Hello, Comrade Luofu.

515
23:17.830 --> 23:18.720
Hello, Comrade Xiangqian.

516
23:18.720 --> 23:19.520
Comrade Bo Gu.

517
23:19.910 --> 23:20.460
Hello.

518
23:20.480 --> 23:20.920
Hello.

519
23:21.450 --> 23:22.520
Comrade Wang Jiaxiang.

520
23:22.520 --> 23:23.380
I'm right here.

521
23:23.850 --> 23:24.200
Hello.

522
23:24.200 --> 23:25.000
Hello.

523
23:26.850 --> 23:28.050
Comrade Liu Bocheng.

524
23:28.170 --> 23:28.920
Comrade Xiangqian.

525
23:28.920 --> 23:29.480
Hello.

526
23:29.850 --> 23:30.780
Comrade Deng Fa.

527
23:31.200 --> 23:31.850
Hello.

528
23:32.620 --> 23:33.210
Hello.

529
23:33.380 --> 23:34.380
Comrade Kai Feng.

530
23:34.440 --> 23:35.530
Hello, Comrade Kai Feng.

531
23:35.530 --> 23:36.850
Thank you for your hard work, Comrade Xiangqian.

532
23:36.850 --> 23:37.910
Comrade Li Fuchun.

533
23:38.170 --> 23:39.570
Thank you for your hard work, Comrade Xiangqian.

534
23:39.570 --> 23:40.090
Hello.

535
23:40.720 --> 23:41.610
Xiangqian,

536
23:42.090 --> 23:43.480
before we start the meeting,

537
23:43.480 --> 23:45.280
there is another important activity.

538
23:45.280 --> 23:47.840
Although conditions are limited and everything is simple,

539
23:47.840 --> 23:49.840
we still need to have this ceremony.

540
23:50.130 --> 23:52.410
That is, we will officially

541
23:52.650 --> 23:54.370
issue you a medal.

542
23:54.460 --> 23:55.740
A... a medal?

543
23:56.920 --> 23:58.410
During the First National Soviet Congress,

544
23:58.410 --> 24:00.740
to commend comrades who made important contributions

545
24:00.740 --> 24:02.280
to the Soviet movement nationwide,

546
24:02.280 --> 24:03.720
the Red Flag Medal was awarded.

547
24:03.720 --> 24:06.170
You were one of the first eight

548
24:06.240 --> 24:07.970
comrades to receive the medal.

549
24:08.130 --> 24:10.040
Since you didn't attend the meeting,

550
24:10.040 --> 24:11.670
that medal has been kept

551
24:11.920 --> 24:13.840
by the Soviet government for you.

552
24:14.850 --> 24:15.930
Xiangqian is here.

553
24:17.200 --> 24:18.130
Comrade Guotao.

554
24:19.680 --> 24:21.810
Perfect, Comrade Guotao has arrived.

555
24:21.930 --> 24:22.870
Now then,

556
24:24.840 --> 24:27.660
on behalf of the Chinese Soviet Government,

557
24:28.040 --> 24:30.090
I award this medal to you.

558
24:44.380 --> 24:45.510
Comrade Xiangqian.

559
24:45.690 --> 24:46.750
Congratulations.

560
24:47.720 --> 24:49.120
Thank you, Chairman Mao.

561
24:54.410 --> 24:55.090
Xiangqian.

562
24:56.890 --> 24:57.750
Comrade Changhao.

563
24:57.750 --> 24:58.930
Hello, Chairman Mao.

564
24:58.930 --> 25:00.530
Let me shake this hand of yours

565
25:00.530 --> 25:02.510
that can scatter leaflets

566
25:02.540 --> 25:04.600
and throw grenades from an airplane.

567
25:05.340 --> 25:07.540
Was the plane shaking badly at that time?

568
25:07.540 --> 25:08.070
I forgot.

569
25:08.570 --> 25:10.370
Enlai, let's start the meeting.

570
25:10.760 --> 25:11.330
Okay.

571
25:11.360 --> 25:13.360
Comrades, let's start the meeting.

572
25:13.520 --> 25:15.350
Let's move the tables to the center.

573
25:15.350 --> 25:16.330
-Okay. -Okay.

574
25:16.330 --> 25:17.580
Let's all help.

575
25:20.520 --> 25:23.280
From July 21st to 22nd,

576
25:23.900 --> 25:26.090
the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee

577
25:26.090 --> 25:28.170
held a meeting in Luhua and decided to establish

578
25:28.170 --> 25:31.030
the Red Army Frontline General Headquarters.

579
25:31.610 --> 25:33.340
Xu Xiangqian and Chen Changhao

580
25:33.520 --> 25:37.000
were appointed as Commander-in-Chief and Political Commissar respectively,

581
25:37.000 --> 25:38.860
and Ye Jianying as Chief of Staff.

582
25:39.280 --> 25:41.930
And according to the latest plan formulated by the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

583
25:41.930 --> 25:44.480
the "Second Step Plan for the Songpan Campaign,"

584
25:44.480 --> 25:45.650
the 1st and 4th Front Armies

585
25:45.650 --> 25:48.680
were reorganized into five columns and one detachment

586
25:48.680 --> 25:51.200
to continue north and capture Songpan.

587
25:52.330 --> 25:55.200
The meeting also discussed the work

588
25:55.200 --> 25:56.400
of the 4th Front Army,

589
25:56.920 --> 25:58.850
affirming its past achievements

590
25:59.220 --> 26:00.980
while pointing out

591
26:01.010 --> 26:03.360
its mistakes and shortcomings.

592
26:03.890 --> 26:07.090
However, due to serious differences of opinion among the attendees,

593
26:07.090 --> 26:10.640
a unified understanding was not reached in the end.

594
26:11.000 --> 26:16.300
[Chengdu, Sichuan]

595
26:11.680 --> 26:12.410
In recent days,

596
26:12.410 --> 26:14.410
the Communist Army has launched multiple attacks

597
26:14.410 --> 26:15.370
on the outer defenses of Songpan,

598
26:15.370 --> 26:16.770
but none have succeeded.

599
26:17.240 --> 26:19.890
Generalissimo, there is something strange.

600
26:20.370 --> 26:21.200
Speak.

601
26:21.480 --> 26:22.170
Yes.

602
26:22.930 --> 26:23.680
At the beginning of the campaign,

603
26:23.680 --> 26:24.520
the army of Shoushan (Hu Zongnan)

604
26:24.520 --> 26:25.570
were not fully deployed.

605
26:25.570 --> 26:27.830
The Communist Army actually had a chance

606
26:27.960 --> 26:29.220
to gain the upper hand.

607
26:29.760 --> 26:31.170
But for some reason,

608
26:31.480 --> 26:32.960
both the Zhu-Mao Communist Army

609
26:32.960 --> 26:34.570
and Xu Xiangqian's troops

610
26:34.760 --> 26:36.810
seemed much more sluggish than before,

611
26:36.810 --> 26:39.280
making it difficult to sustain their attacks.

612
26:39.280 --> 26:40.740
Have you found the reason?

613
26:40.760 --> 26:41.960
I can't figure it out.

614
26:42.040 --> 26:43.000
But anyway,

615
26:43.090 --> 26:44.170
this is a good thing.

616
26:44.170 --> 26:45.290
I've asked Yuanjing (He Guoguang)

617
26:45.290 --> 26:46.000
to formulate an

618
26:46.000 --> 26:48.930
"Outline Plan for the Annihilation of Bandits in the Sichuan-Gansu Border Area."

619
26:48.930 --> 26:51.650
Let them handle the battle in Songpan.

620
26:52.370 --> 26:54.000
Generalissimo, dinner is ready.

621
26:54.000 --> 26:54.810
Okay.

622
26:55.890 --> 26:57.040
You haven't eaten yet, have you?

623
26:57.040 --> 26:57.850
Not yet.

624
26:58.090 --> 27:00.240
Then let's eat together here.

625
27:00.480 --> 27:01.060
Yes.

626
27:03.090 --> 27:05.550
Xue Yue's troops have arrived near Chengdu.

627
27:05.980 --> 27:08.980
I think it's time to solve the Sichuan problem.

628
27:15.160 --> 27:17.430
Do you remember

629
27:17.450 --> 27:18.770
the Lushan Officers Training Corps we organized?

630
27:18.770 --> 27:19.430
I remember.

631
27:19.830 --> 27:21.250
I plan to organize in Mount Emei

632
27:21.250 --> 27:23.200
an Emei Officers Training Corps.

633
27:25.130 --> 27:26.730
I will serve as the commander

634
27:27.610 --> 27:29.340
of this training corps myself.

635
27:29.960 --> 27:31.520
Liu Xiang, Liu Wenhui,

636
27:31.610 --> 27:33.810
Deng Xihou, and Yang Sen will be deputy commanders.

637
27:33.810 --> 27:35.890
You will be the dean of education.

638
27:36.040 --> 27:36.720
What do you think?

639
27:36.720 --> 27:37.330
Okay.

640
27:46.200 --> 27:47.330
Cixiu (Chen Cheng).

641
27:47.410 --> 27:49.000
I want you to be the dean of education

642
27:49.000 --> 27:51.050
so that in this training corps,

643
27:51.810 --> 27:55.370
you can cultivate a group of loyal soldiers for the Party.

644
27:56.280 --> 27:57.410
Please rest assured, Generalissimo.

645
27:57.410 --> 27:58.440
I will do my best

646
27:58.470 --> 27:59.650
to complete the task.

647
27:59.650 --> 28:00.200
Good.

648
28:04.270 --> 28:11.900
[Temporary Encampment of the Military Commission, Mao'ergai, Sichuan]

649
28:30.950 --> 28:32.210
Commander-in-Chief.

650
28:32.480 --> 28:33.460
Comrade Jiaxiang.

651
28:33.460 --> 28:34.760
Comrade Enlai, how is it?

652
28:34.760 --> 28:35.640
Are you feeling better?

653
28:35.640 --> 28:36.040
Much better.

654
28:36.040 --> 28:36.900
Come, sit down.

655
28:37.040 --> 28:37.570
Come.

656
28:37.850 --> 28:38.710
Sit in my chair.

657
28:38.850 --> 28:40.180
It's more comfortable.

658
28:40.760 --> 28:41.390
Thank you.

659
28:41.930 --> 28:43.000
No need to say thanks.

660
28:43.000 --> 28:44.200
At the Zunyi Conference,

661
28:44.200 --> 28:46.090
didn't you get me a recliner?

662
28:47.280 --> 28:49.300
I'm just a man of leisure now.

663
28:51.330 --> 28:51.930
Enlai,

664
28:52.520 --> 28:53.580
for over a year now,

665
28:53.810 --> 28:55.210
you've been the busiest.

666
28:55.350 --> 28:56.270
Mao said

667
28:56.840 --> 28:58.720
your illness is from exhaustion.

668
28:59.890 --> 29:01.370
It's rare to have a few days off.

669
29:01.370 --> 29:03.440
Chatting with us

670
29:03.610 --> 29:04.940
is also a contribution.

671
29:07.370 --> 29:09.230
How is the situation at the front?

672
29:11.340 --> 29:12.300
It's a mess.

673
29:12.930 --> 29:15.340
Zhang Guotao is messing around again.

674
29:15.680 --> 29:18.230
Under the pretext that the addition of members to the Central Committee and the Military Commission

675
29:18.230 --> 29:20.090
had not been approved by the Central Committee,

676
29:20.090 --> 29:21.420
he arbitrarily changed

677
29:21.440 --> 29:23.410
the combat orders of the

678
29:23.410 --> 29:24.370
"Second Step Plan for the Songpan Campaign",

679
29:24.370 --> 29:25.960
halted the troops of the 4th Front Army,

680
29:25.960 --> 29:26.720
and proposed

681
29:27.170 --> 29:29.410
to hold a Politburo meeting

682
29:29.610 --> 29:31.540
to resolve political line issues.

683
29:33.760 --> 29:35.850
Does he have any Party spirit

684
29:36.610 --> 29:38.530
or organizational discipline in his head?

685
29:38.530 --> 29:40.920
I think all he has in his head now

686
29:41.650 --> 29:42.850
is power.

687
29:43.440 --> 29:46.280
No sooner had the Central Committee issued the order appointing him General Political Commissar

688
29:46.280 --> 29:47.140
than he ordered

689
29:47.280 --> 29:50.610
the confiscation of the telegraph codebooks of all armies,

690
29:50.910 --> 29:52.210
including the secret codes

691
29:52.210 --> 29:54.520
between the armies and the Central Military Commission.

692
29:54.520 --> 29:55.370
From now on,

693
29:55.400 --> 29:56.810
communication between the armies,

694
29:56.810 --> 29:58.930
and between the armies and the Central Military Commission,

695
29:58.930 --> 30:01.210
must go through Zhang Guotao.

696
30:04.480 --> 30:06.410
The Songpan Campaign is imminent.

697
30:06.850 --> 30:09.320
We have already delayed the opportunity for over 20 days.

698
30:09.320 --> 30:11.920
How can we fight this battle if this continues?

699
30:15.060 --> 30:15.960
Comrade Bocheng.

700
30:15.960 --> 30:17.090
Vice Chairman Zhou.

701
30:17.540 --> 30:18.480
Is there any new information?

702
30:18.480 --> 30:19.040
Bocheng.

703
30:19.930 --> 30:21.660
The Second Bureau intercepted

704
30:22.330 --> 30:24.890
an “Outline Plan for Communist Suppression in the Sichuan-Gansu Border Area,”

705
30:24.890 --> 30:28.030
drafted a few days earlier by the Chongqing Headquarters Staff Regiment of Chiang Kai-shek.

706
30:28.030 --> 30:29.810
Its targeted deployment of forces

707
30:29.810 --> 30:32.890
is basically consistent with our "Songpan Campaign Plan."

708
30:32.890 --> 30:33.820
Intelligence shows

709
30:33.820 --> 30:36.620
that the enemy has already assembled in position.

710
30:48.240 --> 30:50.720
On July 31, 1935,

711
30:51.440 --> 30:53.250
due to changes in the enemy's situation,

712
30:53.250 --> 30:55.680
the favorable opportunity for the Red Army to capture Songpan

713
30:55.680 --> 30:56.680
had been lost.

714
30:57.850 --> 30:59.440
the Central Revolutionary Military Commission decided

715
30:59.440 --> 31:01.500
to halt the "Songpan Campaign Plan."

716
31:02.200 --> 31:03.000
At this point,

717
31:03.040 --> 31:06.280
the road for the main force of the Red Army to march north from Songpan to southern Gansu

718
31:06.280 --> 31:07.850
was completely blocked.

719
31:08.260 --> 31:09.240
The Central Revolutionary Military Commission

720
31:09.240 --> 31:11.440
had to reformulate the northward plan,

721
31:12.090 --> 31:15.350
deciding to march north to Aba via the area west of Songpan,

722
31:15.720 --> 31:17.450
and then enter southern Gansu.

723
31:17.960 --> 31:18.960
This meant

724
31:19.230 --> 31:22.690
that the Red Army would be forced to cross the vast grasslands,

725
31:23.520 --> 31:27.180
enduring a life-and-death test in a deadly natural environment.

726
31:29.670 --> 31:32.310
According to Zhang Guotao's suggestion,

727
31:32.960 --> 31:34.090
the two front armies

728
31:34.170 --> 31:36.760
were mixed into the Left and Right Route Armies.

729
31:36.760 --> 31:39.200
The 5th, 9th, 31st,

730
31:39.440 --> 31:41.150
32nd, and 33rd Armies,

731
31:41.170 --> 31:43.760
a total of five armies, will form the Left Route Army.

732
31:43.760 --> 31:45.890
Led by Zhu De,

733
31:46.240 --> 31:48.810
Zhang Guotao, and Liu Bocheng of the Red Army Headquarters,

734
31:48.810 --> 31:51.410
they will advance north from Zhuokeji to Aba,

735
31:51.650 --> 31:53.520
and then further north to Xiahe.

736
31:54.460 --> 31:56.020
The 1st, 3rd,

737
31:56.040 --> 31:58.900
4th, and 30th Armies will form the Right Route Army.

738
31:59.000 --> 32:01.000
Led by the Red Army Frontline General Headquarters'

739
32:01.000 --> 32:02.660
Xu Xiangqian, Chen Changhao,

740
32:02.960 --> 32:04.040
and Ye Jianying,

741
32:05.330 --> 32:07.190
they will depart from Mao'ergai,

742
32:07.330 --> 32:10.280
cross the grasslands, and arrive in the Banyou and Baxi regions.

743
32:10.280 --> 32:11.340
He emphasized that

744
32:11.420 --> 32:14.480
the central organs will move with the Right Route Army.

745
32:25.520 --> 32:28.050
The two front armies have just joined forces,

746
32:28.420 --> 32:29.890
and the situation is so severe.

747
32:29.890 --> 32:31.350
At this time, Zhang Guotao

748
32:31.370 --> 32:32.890
suggested splitting the troops into two routes,

749
32:32.890 --> 32:34.460
transferring the Commander-in-Chief and Comrade Bocheng

750
32:34.460 --> 32:35.350
to his side.

751
32:35.650 --> 32:38.650
He also emphasized that the central organs should follow the Right Route Army.

752
32:38.650 --> 32:39.980
How can we agree to that?

753
32:40.650 --> 32:41.780
What is he thinking?

754
32:42.170 --> 32:44.370
He doesn't want to act with the Central Committee.

755
32:44.370 --> 32:47.000
Zhang Guotao has selfish motives.

756
32:47.520 --> 32:49.520
The reason Zhang Guotao gave is that

757
32:49.570 --> 32:52.480
collecting grain in the Tibetan area is very difficult.

758
32:52.480 --> 32:54.440
If tens of thousands of troops act together,

759
32:54.440 --> 32:56.500
logistics will be hard to guarantee.

760
32:56.580 --> 32:57.210
Yes.

761
33:01.280 --> 33:03.170
Judging from the current situation,

762
33:03.170 --> 33:05.640
the reasons he gave are sufficient and objective,

763
33:05.640 --> 33:06.850
making it hard to refuse.

764
33:06.850 --> 33:07.960
If we refuse,

765
33:08.160 --> 33:10.500
the label of being selfish and destroying unity

766
33:10.500 --> 33:12.560
will be put on our Central Committee.

767
33:17.680 --> 33:20.170
As long as the Red Army can successfully go north,

768
33:20.170 --> 33:22.410
I, Zhu De, am not afraid of trouble

769
33:23.570 --> 33:24.810
or hardship.

770
33:26.470 --> 33:27.200
It's just...

771
33:27.920 --> 33:30.380
It's just that Zhu and Mao will be separated.

772
33:37.090 --> 33:38.890
Zhu and Mao cannot be separated.

773
33:54.130 --> 33:56.790
[Zhuokeji, Lifan County, Sichuan]

774
34:00.810 --> 34:01.520
Chairman.

775
34:03.280 --> 34:05.170
The Central Revolutionary Military Commission has officially issued

776
34:05.170 --> 34:06.440
the Xia-Tao Campaign Plan,

777
34:06.440 --> 34:07.940
deciding to divide the troops into two routes

778
34:07.940 --> 34:09.870
and march north to southern Gansu.

779
34:13.730 --> 34:14.730
What do you think?

780
34:14.810 --> 34:17.639
Dividing the troops was your suggestion.

781
34:17.960 --> 34:19.730
The Central Committee and the Military Commission didn't object.

782
34:19.730 --> 34:20.860
This is a good thing.

783
34:20.960 --> 34:22.360
But I'm a little worried.

784
34:22.520 --> 34:24.480
The Fourth Red Army and the 30th Army

785
34:24.480 --> 34:26.739
are the main forces of our 4th Front Army.

786
34:27.150 --> 34:28.520
Now they are all in the Right Route Army,

787
34:28.520 --> 34:30.120
acting together with the Central Committee.

788
34:30.120 --> 34:30.770
If...

789
34:32.120 --> 34:35.690
The Right Route Army is commanded by the Frontline General Headquarters.

790
34:35.690 --> 34:37.420
Xu Xiangqian and Chen Changhao

791
34:37.620 --> 34:39.949
are both comrades from our 4th Front Army.

792
34:40.250 --> 34:41.630
What is there to worry about?

793
34:41.630 --> 34:43.420
And this exactly shows

794
34:43.889 --> 34:46.489
that I, Zhang Guotao, have no selfish motives.

795
34:48.409 --> 34:49.330
I understand.

796
34:50.040 --> 34:52.370
Then I will go and officially issue it now.

797
34:53.000 --> 34:54.000
Wait a minute.

798
35:01.720 --> 35:04.920
We still need to solve the organizational problems first

799
35:06.850 --> 35:11.040
to better carry out military operations.

800
35:12.730 --> 35:16.130
Send a telegram to the Central Committee and urge them again.

801
35:17.850 --> 35:20.120
Zhang Guotao is holding his troops back,

802
35:20.770 --> 35:24.810
proposing that the Central Committee hold a Politburo meeting as soon as possible

803
35:24.810 --> 35:25.960
for the so-called

804
35:26.250 --> 35:27.730
errors in the Central Committee's political line

805
35:27.730 --> 35:28.660
to be clarified.

806
35:29.250 --> 35:32.040
And to solve the organizational problems,

807
35:32.440 --> 35:36.330
he demands that the Central Committee absorb cadres from the 4th Front Army

808
35:36.330 --> 35:38.520
into the Central Committee and the Politburo.

809
35:38.520 --> 35:40.650
This is the specific list he proposed.

810
35:42.420 --> 35:43.610
His list...

811
35:44.520 --> 35:46.450
Just counting Politburo members,

812
35:46.520 --> 35:47.520
they have nine.

813
35:47.870 --> 35:49.700
While we only have six

814
35:49.890 --> 35:51.040
Politburo members on our side.

815
35:51.040 --> 35:51.810
It's obvious

816
35:52.370 --> 35:55.440
he doesn't recognize the Central Committee after the Zunyi Conference

817
35:55.440 --> 35:57.700
and wants to gain a numerical advantage.

818
36:01.160 --> 36:02.480
He's using his advantage to force a takeover,

819
36:02.480 --> 36:04.410
letting the gun command the Party!

820
36:08.000 --> 36:08.730
Back then,

821
36:09.730 --> 36:12.000
I proposed giving the position of General Secretary

822
36:12.000 --> 36:13.080
to Zhang Guotao.

823
36:13.560 --> 36:15.890
Fortunately, Comrade Zedong stopped me.

824
36:15.960 --> 36:16.760
Otherwise...

825
36:16.930 --> 36:20.480
Today is not as simple as

826
36:20.730 --> 36:22.460
bargaining with Zhang Guotao.

827
36:28.250 --> 36:30.110
It is necessary to hold a meeting,

828
36:30.290 --> 36:32.490
but its starting point is not struggle.

829
36:32.730 --> 36:36.260
We still have to start from the unity of the whole Party and army.

830
36:36.290 --> 36:37.350
We must try our best

831
36:38.550 --> 36:40.160
to win over Zhang Guotao.

832
36:42.690 --> 36:43.550
I'm just afraid

833
36:44.440 --> 36:45.640
he will push his luck.

834
36:46.520 --> 36:48.410
Regarding his excessive demands,

835
36:48.410 --> 36:49.730
we must make special

836
36:50.370 --> 36:52.100
and very patient concessions.

837
36:52.370 --> 36:54.770
But we must never compromise on principles.

838
36:54.770 --> 36:56.390
Marching north to resist Japanese aggression

839
36:56.390 --> 36:58.200
is our absolute principle.

840
36:59.080 --> 37:01.680
Then how should we reply to him about this list?

841
37:02.080 --> 37:04.410
It's impossible to accept it completely.

842
37:05.810 --> 37:08.120
But we should make appropriate concessions.

843
37:08.120 --> 37:10.370
The comrades of the 4th Front Army on this list

844
37:10.370 --> 37:12.960
may not be the kind of people Zhang Guotao thinks they are.

845
37:12.960 --> 37:14.120
Once they enter the Central Committee,

846
37:14.120 --> 37:16.770
they can understand more of the actual situation.

847
37:16.770 --> 37:18.210
In the future, they will understand

848
37:18.210 --> 37:20.520
the good intentions of our Central Committee.

849
37:20.520 --> 37:22.730
Then let's hold a meeting immediately.

850
37:24.380 --> 37:24.870
Good.

851
37:39.760 --> 37:43.140
[Shawo Village, Songpan, Sichuan]

852
38:12.650 --> 38:14.410
The leaders can go in for the meeting.

853
38:14.410 --> 38:16.940
Other comrades can rest outside the village.

854
38:19.200 --> 38:20.330
What does this mean?

855
38:20.640 --> 38:21.570
Comrade Guotao.

856
38:23.500 --> 38:24.430
Comrade Guotao.

857
38:25.160 --> 38:26.600
This is the rule of the meeting.

858
38:26.600 --> 38:28.250
This meeting is of great importance.

859
38:28.250 --> 38:28.930
Doing this

860
38:29.180 --> 38:31.580
is also to ensure the safety of the meeting.

861
38:41.690 --> 38:42.640
Comrade Luofu.

862
38:43.850 --> 38:46.850
This is the defense area of my 12th Division.

863
38:47.450 --> 38:49.050
How could it be unsafe?

864
38:51.890 --> 38:52.820
Comrade Guotao,

865
38:53.470 --> 38:55.220
this is the Central Committee's regulation.

866
38:55.220 --> 38:57.930
[Fu Zhong, Deputy Director of the Political Department of the Red 4th Front Army]

867
38:58.000 --> 38:59.160
You wait outside!

868
38:59.930 --> 39:00.460
Let's go.

869
39:00.820 --> 39:01.280
Please.

870
39:04.330 --> 39:05.160
Who is here?

871
39:06.160 --> 39:07.090
Comrade Zedong,

872
39:07.290 --> 39:08.150
Comrade Zhu De,

873
39:08.290 --> 39:09.160
Comrade Enlai,

874
39:09.520 --> 39:10.520
Comrade Bocheng,

875
39:10.520 --> 39:11.330
Comrade Bo Gu,

876
39:11.370 --> 39:12.250
and Comrade Deng Fa

877
39:12.250 --> 39:13.250
have all arrived.

878
39:39.930 --> 39:41.040
The road is rough.

879
39:41.960 --> 39:43.480
Sorry to keep you waiting.

880
39:47.600 --> 39:48.520
Comrade Guotao.

881
39:48.520 --> 39:49.580
Comrade Changhao.

882
39:49.620 --> 39:50.370
Comrade Fu Zhong.

883
39:50.370 --> 39:51.250
Thank you for your hard work.

884
39:51.250 --> 39:52.710
Come, let's welcome them.

885
39:59.060 --> 40:00.560
Comrade Fu Zhong, have a seat.

886
40:00.560 --> 40:02.360
Comrade Guotao, come, sit here.

887
40:02.360 --> 40:03.420
I'll just sit here.

888
40:22.700 --> 40:23.540
Actually,

889
40:24.050 --> 40:27.520
there are some conflicts between the 1st and the 4th Front Army.

890
40:27.520 --> 40:29.250
It's normal to have arguments.

891
40:29.870 --> 40:30.850
We are holding this meeting

892
40:30.850 --> 40:32.680
to resolve conflicts

893
40:32.810 --> 40:34.740
and understand each other, right?

894
40:35.000 --> 40:35.850
I'm afraid

895
40:35.960 --> 40:37.760
we can't say there are conflicts

896
40:38.120 --> 40:40.250
between the 1st and the 4th Front Army.

897
40:40.420 --> 40:43.630
The commanders and fighters of the Red Army are all revolutionary comrades.

898
40:43.630 --> 40:45.440
Everyone hopes for unity.

899
40:50.160 --> 40:51.120
Comrade Enlai,

900
40:52.600 --> 40:54.000
I want unity too.

901
40:54.520 --> 40:55.580
But the problem is,

902
40:56.210 --> 40:59.120
I know many comrades have opinions about me.

903
40:59.890 --> 41:03.270
Some say I, Zhang Guotao, rely on my seniority

904
41:03.290 --> 41:05.490
and look down on the Politburo members.

905
41:05.910 --> 41:07.510
They say I'm an opportunist.

906
41:08.060 --> 41:10.020
Some even say I'm a warlord

907
41:10.400 --> 41:13.210
trying to use military power to threaten the Central Committee.

908
41:13.210 --> 41:15.120
Isn't this completely fabricated?

909
41:15.120 --> 41:17.600
Do you think this is conducive to unity?

910
41:18.290 --> 41:19.220
Comrade Guotao.

911
41:19.410 --> 41:21.670
These rumors are nothing to worry about.

912
41:21.710 --> 41:24.040
In my opinion, don't pay attention to them.

913
41:24.040 --> 41:25.210
A clear conscience

914
41:25.480 --> 41:27.080
fears no false accusations.

915
41:27.250 --> 41:29.770
As long as you have a clear conscience, who cares?

916
41:29.770 --> 41:30.690
Right, Guotao,

917
41:30.930 --> 41:31.530
Changhao?

918
41:33.290 --> 41:34.080
Makes sense.

919
41:35.480 --> 41:36.880
Let's start the meeting.

920
41:37.480 --> 41:39.480
Comrades, let's start the meeting.

921
41:40.370 --> 41:43.250
From August 4 to 6, 1935,

922
41:43.870 --> 41:45.750
the Politburo held a meeting

923
41:45.780 --> 41:47.340
in Shawo near Mao'ergai.

924
41:48.370 --> 41:49.970
After intense discussions,

925
41:50.000 --> 41:51.810
on August 5, they passed

926
41:52.140 --> 41:54.340
the "Resolution of the Central Committee on the Political Situation

927
41:54.340 --> 41:55.070
and Tasks After the Joining of

928
41:55.070 --> 41:57.670
the 1st and the 4th Front Army."

929
41:58.310 --> 41:59.200
The "Resolution" reiterated

930
41:59.200 --> 42:01.080
that the strategic policy of attacking northward,

931
42:01.080 --> 42:02.770
decided at the Lianghekou Conference,

932
42:02.770 --> 42:03.960
was correct.

933
42:04.300 --> 42:08.040
It reiterated that creating the Sichuan-Shaanxi-Gansu Central Soviet base area

934
42:08.040 --> 42:10.080
was the historical task placed before

935
42:10.080 --> 42:11.640
the 1st and the 4th Front Army.

936
42:11.640 --> 42:13.120
The "Resolution" directly answered

937
42:13.120 --> 42:16.480
the quetions that emerged after the joining of the two major front armies.

938
42:16.480 --> 42:18.680
It emphasized the importance of unity.

939
42:19.040 --> 42:21.810
It emphasized the necessity of strengthening the Party's

940
42:21.810 --> 42:23.370
absolute leadership over the army.

941
42:23.370 --> 42:24.890
Regarding Zhang Guotao's

942
42:25.010 --> 42:26.250
proposed erroneous strategic policy

943
42:26.250 --> 42:27.830
of advancing west and south,

944
42:27.830 --> 42:30.480
his warlord tendency of the gun commanding the Party,

945
42:30.480 --> 42:33.940
and his actions undermining the unity of the two front armies,

946
42:33.960 --> 42:35.810
it gave appropriate criticism.

947
42:36.850 --> 42:37.640
Comrades,

948
42:38.000 --> 42:40.890
on behalf of the Politburo, I announce

949
42:41.220 --> 42:43.390
the addition of Comrades Xu Xiangqian,

950
42:43.390 --> 42:45.990
Chen Changhao, and Zhou Chunquan

951
42:46.230 --> 42:47.560
as members of the Central Committee.

952
42:47.560 --> 42:51.290
The addition of Comrades Chen Changhao and Zhou Chunquan

953
42:51.560 --> 42:52.770
as members of the Politburo.

954
42:52.770 --> 42:55.300
The addition of Comrades He Wei, Li Xiannian,

955
42:55.320 --> 42:56.600
and Fu Zhong

956
42:56.770 --> 42:58.890
as alternate members of the Central Committee.
